The code snippet does not explicitly handle multi-byte character sequences, which could lead to an out-of-bounds read if the input contains an invalid or incomplete multi-byte sequence. Therefore, the code snippet contains similar vulnerability behaviors mentioned in the vulnerability knowledge.

